---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer';
import AudioPlayerWidget from '../components/AudioPlayerWidget';
import { Cpu, GameController, Code, Sparkle, ShieldCheck, Heart } from '@phosphor-icons/react';
---

<Layout 
	title="About Us & Engineering Story - Dino Run Epochs"
	description="Learn about Dino Run Epochs, our mission to reinvent the classic 1991 offline dinosaur runner into an open 60FPS WebAssembly arcade with procedural biomes, Flame 2D, and Rive bone physics."
	canonicalPath="/about"
>
	<Navbar pathname={Astro.url.pathname} client:load />
	
	<main class="w-full pt-32 pb-20 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1100px] mx-auto text-slate-200">
		<header class="mb-14 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-['Geist_Mono'] font-medium mb-4">
				ORIGIN & MISSION
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] uppercase leading-tight">
				REIMAGINING THE ARCADE FOR <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-teal-400">THE OPEN WEB</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch] font-['Outfit']">
				Dino Run Epochs was born from a singular passion: transforming the beloved, monochromatic offline dinosaur easter egg into a cinematic, 60FPS multi-biome arcade experience that anyone can play instantly without downloads.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="space-y-16 font-['Outfit'] text-slate-300">
			
			{/* Mission Grid */}
			<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border-white/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-4">
						<GameController size={22} weight="duotone" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="font-['Chakra_Petch'] font-bold text-lg text-white mb-2">Zero Barrier Gaming</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
						No app store downloads, zero 2GB updates, and no aggressive paywalls. We believe pure skill-based browser games should be instant and accessible across all devices.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border-white/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400 mb-4">
						<Cpu size={22} weight="duotone" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="font-['Chakra_Petch'] font-bold text-lg text-white mb-2">Native 60FPS Engineering</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
						By compiling Dart and Flutter Flame directly into WebAssembly (WASM) with Skia CanvasKit GPU rendering, we deliver console-grade input latencies under 16 milliseconds.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border-white/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-4">
						<Sparkle size={22} weight="duotone" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="font-['Chakra_Petch'] font-bold text-lg text-white mb-2">Procedural Evolution</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
						Instead of a static desert loop, our engine smoothly morphs through 6 distinct geological and atmospheric epochs, challenging reflex adaptations continuously.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* The Studio Story */}
			<section class="space-y-6">
				<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] flex items-center gap-3">
					<Code size={28} className="text-emerald-400" />
					The Architecture Behind the Game
				</h2>
				<div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-base">
					<p>
						In 2014, Google Chrome introduced the offline T-Rex runner created by Sebastien Gabriel and Alan Bettes. It was an instant worldwide sensation—a charming distraction whenever connectivity faltered. However, for a decade, the mechanics remained largely unchanged: single-color 8-bit sprites, linear obstacle spawning, and sudden abrupt failure states.
					</p>
					<p>
						At <strong>Dino Run Epochs Studio</strong>, we asked: <em>What happens when you bring modern state-machine skeletal rigging, procedural shader interpolation, and dynamic sound synthesis to this beloved formula?</em>
					</p>
					<p>
						The result is Dino Run Epochs. Using Google’s Flutter framework paired with the Flame 2D game engine, we crafted a completely custom obstacle physics pipeline:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
						<li><strong>Sub-Pixel Collision Boxes:</strong> Accurate multi-point hitbox polygons that reward narrow near-misses rather than triggering cheap collision deaths.</li>
						<li><strong>Atmospheric Sine-Wave Transitions:</strong> Every 4,500 points (~3.5 minutes of flawless running), a procedural weather fog sweeps the screen while background and ground shaders interpolate smoothly without pausing the action.</li>
						<li><strong>Rive Skeletal Rigging:</strong> Instead of simple bitmap frame swapping, our vector models utilize bone-weighted inverse kinematics that tilt with forward momentum and react organically to jumping and ducking.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Developer Story */}
			<section class="space-y-6 bg-slate-900/50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-10 text-emerald-500 pointer-events-none">
					<Code size={120} weight="duotone" />
				</div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] flex items-center gap-3 relative z-10">
					<Heart size={28} className="text-rose-400" weight="fill" />
					A Note from the Developer
				</h2>
				<div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-base relative z-10">
					<p>
						Hi, I'm Gurpreet Singh, the sole developer behind Dino Run Epochs. 
					</p>
					<p>
						When I first started building this game in Flutter and Flame, my goal wasn't just to make another endless runner clone. I wanted to see how far the WebAssembly boundary could be pushed. The original Chrome Dino game is an absolute masterpiece of minimalist design, but I always wondered what would happen if the dinosaur actually <em>escaped</em> the desert.
					</p>
					<p>
						That thought experiment led to the <strong>Epochs system</strong>. Instead of just speeding up infinitely, the game forces you to adapt to entirely new visual paradigms—from the blinding whiteouts of the Ice Age to the particle-heavy visual noise of the Volcano biome. It's a love letter to the original, engineered with modern web technologies. 
					</p>
					<p>
						Everything you see here—the skeletal animations, the shader transitions, and this web portal—was built from the ground up to ensure you get the absolute best 60FPS experience right in your browser.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Editorial Integrity & Standards */}
			<section class="p-8 rounded-2xl glass-card border border-white/10 space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] flex items-center gap-2">
					<ShieldCheck size={24} className="text-amber-400" />
					Editorial Standards & Player Transparency
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
					Every strategy guide, game mechanic breakdown, and lore entry published on Dino Run Epochs is researched, authored, and verified by our in-house engineering and game design team. We do not publish automated, unverified content scrapings. Our technical benchmarks, velocity graphs, and hitbox values are drawn directly from the production Flame game loop source code.
				</p>
				<div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-['Geist_Mono'] text-slate-400">
					<span>• Independently Developed</span>
					<span>• WebAssembly Compliant</span>
					<span>• Non-Intrusive Ad Experience</span>
					<span>• Community Driven</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Team CTA */}
			<section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-950 border border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-['Chakra_Petch'] font-bold text-xl text-white">Have Feedback or Ideas for Epoch 07?</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">We actively read player feedback, bug submissions, and high score reports.</p>
				</div>
				<a 
					href="/contact"
					class="shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-['Chakra_Petch'] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all shadow-md"
				>
					Get in Touch
				</a>
			</section>

		</div>
	</main>

	<AudioPlayerWidget client:load />
	<Footer client:visible />
</Layout>
